        "content": "Addressed PR review comments:\n1. Extracted AC coverage computation to shared computeACCoverage() utility\n2. Made scanTestCoverage() recursive to scan test subdirectories  \n3. Added console.warn logging when coverage scan fails\n\nPushed commit b97211ce to address Greptile review feedback.",
