    "description": "Daemon fixture loading blocker affected 2/3 tasks across 10 iterations with no alternative approach attempted. Pattern: E2E test harness starts daemon with --kspec-dir pointing to temp fixtures, daemon returns empty data instead of YAML content. Should have tried: run daemon manually with debug output, inspect ContextManager code paths, create minimal reproduction case, or escalate infrastructure debugging to separate focused task.",
    "origin": "observation_promotion",
    "status": "completed",
    "blocked_by": [],
    "closed_reason": "PR #276 merged - E2E reliability improvements: health check polling, staleness detection, PidFileManager sync",
