  {
    "_ulid": "01KG762Y3SH9PCG6DGK8KKYNEV",
    "slugs": [],
    "title": "Fix PR review subagent not completing task after merge",
    "type": "task",
    "spec_ref": "@ralph-subagent-spawning",
    "meta_ref": null,
    "status": "completed",
    "blocked_by": [],
    "closed_reason": "Merged in PR #282. Fixed PR review subagent to complete task after merge by updating prompt exit conditions and adding defensive verification in ralph.",
    "depends_on": [],
    "context": [],
    "priority": 1,
    "tags": [],
    "vcs_refs": [],
    "created_at": "2026-01-30T10:09:54.809Z",
    "started_at": "2026-01-30T10:10:16.116Z",
    "completed_at": "2026-01-30T10:17:32.734Z",
    "notes": [
      {
        "_ulid": "01KG763ASZNQPPQJNY0M2J39N7",
        "created_at": "2026-01-30T10:10:07.807Z",
        "author": "@claude",
        "content": "## Issue Analysis\n\nThe PR review subagent merges PRs but doesn't complete the associated task, leaving it in pending_review for the next iteration where the task limit gets triggered.\n\n### Root Cause\n\n1. **Subagent prompt exit conditions** (src/ralph/subagent.ts:133-136):\n   - Says 'Exit when: PR is merged successfully'\n   - But task completion is step 8 in @pr-review-loop workflow (after merge at step 7)\n   - So subagent exits BEFORE completing the task\n\n2. **Conflicting documentation**:\n   - SKILL.md says task completion is caller's responsibility\n   - @pr-review-loop workflow includes task completion as ac-7\n   - Subagent follows the 'exit when merged' instruction\n\n### Fix Approach\n\n1. **Update subagent prompt** - Change exit conditions to require task completion:\n   - 'PR merged and task completed successfully' (not just 'PR merged')\n\n2. **Check @pr-review-loop workflow** - Ensure consistent messaging\n\n3. **Add defensive check in ralph** - After subagent success:\n   - Verify task transitioned from pending_review to completed\n   - If still pending_review, instruct subagent to complete properly (not auto-complete)\n\n### Files to Modify\n\n- src/ralph/subagent.ts (buildSubagentPrompt)\n- src/cli/commands/ralph.ts (processPendingReviewTasks success path)\n- .kspec/kynetic.meta.yaml (@pr-review-loop if needed)\n- .claude/skills/pr-review/SKILL.md (remove conflicting guidance)",
        "supersedes": null
      },
      {
        "_ulid": "01KG766NMEBG6BFXRTRJ1JHKFH",
        "created_at": "2026-01-30T10:11:57.198Z",
        "author": "@claude",
        "content": "## Implementation Complete\n\n### Changes Made\n\n1. **src/ralph/subagent.ts** (buildSubagentPrompt)\n   - Added step 5: Complete the task with PR reference\n   - Added CRITICAL note requiring task completion\n   - Updated exit conditions: 'PR merged AND task completed successfully'\n   - Added ac-12 to AC annotation\n\n2. **src/cli/commands/ralph.ts** (processPendingReviewTasks)\n   - Added verifyTaskCompleted() helper function\n   - Updated success path to verify task was completed\n   - If task still pending_review after subagent success, marks needs_review with note\n\n3. **.claude/skills/pr-review/SKILL.md**\n   - Replaced 'Integration' section with 'Task Completion' section\n   - Removed guidance about caller completing task\n   - Added CRITICAL note that subagent MUST complete task\n\n4. **.kspec/kynetic.meta.yaml** (spec)\n   - Added ac-12: 'subagent must complete the task; ralph verifies task is completed after subagent success'\n\n### Testing\n- Build succeeds\n- ralph tests pass (11 tests)\n- @pr-review-loop workflow unchanged (already correct)",
        "supersedes": null
      },
      {
        "_ulid": "01KG768AD8RDRY1ENGT2PFX956",
        "created_at": "2026-01-30T10:12:51.240Z",
        "author": "@claude",
        "content": "PR created: #282 https://github.com/kynetic-ai/kynetic-spec/pull/282",
        "supersedes": null
      }
    ],
    "todos": [],
    "_sourceFile": "/workspace/.kspec/project.tasks.yaml"
  },
