  {
    "_ulid": "01KG8Q5GZYKQFYNYV5N216H646",
    "slugs": [],
    "title": "Add signal handlers for ralph marker cleanup on Ctrl+C",
    "type": "task",
    "spec_ref": "@ralph-end-loop",
    "meta_ref": null,
    "status": "completed",
    "blocked_by": [],
    "closed_reason": "Merged in PR #294. Added SIGINT/SIGTERM signal handlers with Promise.all().finally() pattern to ensure marker cleanup completes before process exit.",
    "depends_on": [],
    "context": [],
    "priority": 2,
    "tags": [],
    "vcs_refs": [],
    "created_at": "2026-01-31T00:27:39.901Z",
    "started_at": "2026-01-31T00:27:54.524Z",
    "completed_at": "2026-01-31T00:41:47.666Z",
    "notes": [
      {
        "_ulid": "01KG8Q5T13YNJ1H7KH1P5S6Y8J",
        "created_at": "2026-01-31T00:27:49.155Z",
        "author": "@claude",
        "content": "Scope: Add process signal handlers (SIGINT, SIGTERM) to ralph run command that clean up both marker files before exit.\n\nCross-platform considerations:\n- Node.js process.on('SIGINT') works on Unix\n- On Windows, Ctrl+C triggers SIGINT in Node.js too\n- SIGTERM is Unix-only but harmless to register on Windows\n\nImplementation approach:\n1. Register signal handlers after context is initialized\n2. Handlers call clearTaskLimitMarker() and clearEndIterationMarker()\n3. Also kill agent if running\n4. Then call process.exit()\n\nCovers ac-signal-cleanup on both @ralph-end-iteration and @ralph-task-limit specs.",
        "supersedes": null
      },
      {
        "_ulid": "01KG8Q814J0MS6GN9N6MVE8985",
        "created_at": "2026-01-31T00:29:01.971Z",
        "author": "@claude",
        "content": "Implementation complete. Added SIGINT/SIGTERM handlers that:\n1. Log the signal received\n2. Kill agent if running\n3. Clear both marker files (task-limit and end-iteration)\n4. Exit cleanly\n\nHandlers are removed in finally block to avoid double cleanup on normal exit.\n\nCross-platform note: Node.js handles Ctrl+C as SIGINT on both Unix and Windows.",
        "supersedes": null
      }
    ],
    "todos": [],
    "_sourceFile": "/workspace/.kspec/project.tasks.yaml"
  },
