  {
    "_ulid": "01KGFK9EDFW61N76RCHNR7RVQ0",
    "slugs": [],
    "title": "Fix stale context after processPendingReviewTasks in ralph loop",
    "type": "task",
    "spec_ref": null,
    "meta_ref": null,
    "status": "completed",
    "blocked_by": [],
    "closed_reason": "Merged in PR #297. Fixed ralph loop to refresh context after processPendingReviewTasks completes, preventing premature exit when tasks become unblocked. Added comprehensive integration tests for AC-20 with mock ACP that actually completes tasks. All tests pass in CI.",
    "depends_on": [],
    "context": [],
    "priority": 1,
    "tags": [],
    "vcs_refs": [],
    "created_at": "2026-02-02T16:34:35.055Z",
    "started_at": "2026-02-02T16:36:09.626Z",
    "completed_at": "2026-02-03T09:01:13.803Z",
    "notes": [
      {
        "_ulid": "01KGFK9QXVZ907BEF0KGBR6HRF",
        "created_at": "2026-02-02T16:34:44.795Z",
        "author": "@claude",
        "content": "Bug analysis:\n\nThe ralph loop gathers session context at iteration start, then processes pending_review tasks (which may complete blocking tasks), but then checks for ready tasks using the STALE context.\n\nFlow:\n1. gatherSessionContext() - blocking tasks are in pending_review, dependent tasks show as blocked\n2. processPendingReviewTasks() - subagents complete the blocking tasks  \n3. Check sessionCtx.ready_tasks - STALE! Still shows empty because context was gathered before completions\n\nResult: Loop exits with 'No automation-eligible tasks' even though tasks just became unblocked.\n\nFix: Re-gather context (or re-check ready tasks) AFTER processPendingReviewTasks completes, before the early exit check at lines 1108-1116.\n\nRelevant code: src/cli/commands/ralph.ts lines 1080-1116",
        "supersedes": null
      },
      {
        "_ulid": "01KGFKBTNCDN0FJD6QVV0Q75D9",
        "created_at": "2026-02-02T16:35:53.132Z",
        "author": "@claude",
        "content": "Spec gap confirmed:\n\nAC-19 specifies WHAT to check (automation:eligible ready/in_progress tasks) but not WHEN relative to pending_review processing.\n\nAC-8 in @ralph-subagent-spawning specifies subagent spawning BEFORE main agent, but no AC specifies context refresh AFTER pending_review completes.\n\nProposed AC for @cli-ralph:\n  id: ac-context-refresh-after-pending-review\n  given: processPendingReviewTasks completes during iteration\n  when: checking for loop continuation\n  then: uses freshly gathered task context (not stale from iteration start) to detect tasks that became ready due to dependency unblocking",
        "supersedes": null
      },
      {
        "_ulid": "01KGFKHNFK1FAE1Q9WFKQWMVSZ",
        "created_at": "2026-02-02T16:39:04.435Z",
        "author": "@claude",
        "content": "Fix implemented:\n\nAdded context refresh after processPendingReviewTasks (AC-20). When pending_review tasks exist and are processed, context is re-gathered to detect tasks that became ready due to dependency unblocking.\n\nChanges:\n- src/cli/commands/ralph.ts: After processPendingReviewTasks, check if pending_review_tasks existed. If so, re-gather context before the ready task check. Use refreshed context for prompt building.\n\nAll existing tests pass. Build succeeds.",
        "supersedes": null
      },
      {
        "_ulid": "01KGFKJZRDDPXGF49HCKQBT7NT",
        "created_at": "2026-02-02T16:39:47.725Z",
        "author": "@claude",
        "content": "PR created: https://github.com/kynetic-ai/kynetic-spec/pull/297",
        "supersedes": null
