    "type": "task",
    "description": "kspec plan import parses ACs from the Specs YAML block but does not write them to created spec items. Dry-run shows correct item count but actual import creates items with empty acceptance_criteria arrays. Discovered during batch-exec plan import where 22 ACs had to be added manually via 13 kspec item ac add invocations.",
    "spec_ref": "@plan-import",
    "meta_ref": null,
    "plan_ref": null,
    "status": "completed",
    "blocked_by": [],
    "closed_reason": "Fixed: createSpecItem() now preserves acceptance_criteria. PR #319 merged.",
    "depends_on": [],
    "context": [],
    "priority": 2,
    "tags": [
      "bug",
      "plan"
    ],
    "vcs_refs": [],
    "created_at": "2026-02-05T23:00:57.448Z",
    "started_at": "2026-02-06T00:03:33.089Z",
    "completed_at": "2026-02-06T00:23:51.521Z",
    "notes": [
      {
        "_ulid": "01KGR162P9SW7BPJV7M577377B",
        "created_at": "2026-02-05T23:11:20.265Z",
        "author": "@claude",
        "content": "Additional plan import issue: derive_from_specs copies the full Implementation Notes section verbatim to ALL derived tasks. For batch-exec plan, all 3 tasks got identical 7-point architecture notes even though most points are only relevant to the parent feature task. Implementation Notes should either: (a) only go to the parent feature's task, (b) be scoped per-spec if the plan format supports it, or (c) be attached to the plan record only, not duplicated into tasks.",
        "supersedes": null
      },
      {
        "_ulid": "01KGR2RQFJN9BH2S9RQZCMMK95",
        "created_at": "2026-02-05T23:38:59.954Z",
        "author": "@claude",
        "content": "Additional issue: derive_from_specs doesn't infer task dependencies from spec hierarchy. When a feature has child requirements, the parent feature's task should depends_on the children's tasks (children are building blocks for the parent). Currently all derived tasks have empty depends_on and must be set manually.",
        "supersedes": null
      },
      {
        "_ulid": "01KGR4J0T35FN8JFBN6BQVDP5T",
        "created_at": "2026-02-06T00:10:17.284Z",
        "author": "@claude",
        "content": "Fixed: createSpecItem() in yaml.ts now includes acceptance_criteria in return object. Also fixed dry-run path in plan-import.ts to pass acceptance_criteria to createSpecItem(). Added unit tests (createSpecItem preserves/omits AC) and integration test (imported specs have ACs via item get --json). All 47 plan import tests pass.",
        "supersedes": null
      }
    ],
    "todos": [],
    "_sourceFile": "/workspace/.kspec/project.tasks.yaml"
  },
