        "content": "Implemented session log list command.\n\nAdded to store.ts:\n- SessionLogSummary interface\n- countEventLines() - efficient line counting without JSON parse\n- countIterations() - counts context-iter-*.json files  \n- countTaskCompletions() - scans events for task.complete strings\n- getSessionLogSummary() - gathers all metrics for one session\n- getAllSessionLogSummaries() - gathers metrics for all sessions\n\nAdded to session.ts CLI:\n- 'session log list' subcommand with --status, --agent, --since, --sort, --count, -n flags\n- formatDuration() helper for human-readable duration\n- sortSessions() supporting 5 sort fields (started_at, duration, events, iterations, tasks_completed)\n- formatSessionLogList() table formatter\n- Full JSON mode support via output() pattern\n- --count outputs plain integer (human) or {count: N} (JSON)\n\nTests: 28 new tests in session-log-list.test.ts covering all 7 ACs plus trait coverage.",
