        "content": "Implementation notes:\n\nParse --status value by splitting on comma, then flatten if Commander.js\nprovides an array from repeated flags. Trim whitespace and filter empty\nstrings. Route both tasks list and task list through the shared list\nfunction (from spec 1 refactor) so the fix applies to both. Use\nvalidateEnumOption to validate each status value individually against the\ncorrect enum (TaskStatus for tasks, ImplementationStatus for items). Apply\nsame pattern to item list --status.\n"
