        "content": "Implementation notes:\n\nNew command file src/cli/commands/refs.ts, registered in index.ts. Loads\nall tasks, items, and meta items. Scans each entity reference fields:\nspec_ref, depends_on, implements, relates_to, supersedes, superseded_by,\ntraits, meta_ref, plan_ref, blocked_by. Collects matches grouped by\n(entity_type, field_name). Uses ReferenceIndex for target resolution.\nOutput via output() with grouped human-readable formatter. Performance:\nfull scan of all entities per query -- acceptable for current scale\n(hundreds of items), may need indexing later.\n"
