        "created_at": "2026-02-13T05:06:15.998Z",
        "author": "@claude",
        "content": "Infra fix: when loop exits because no eligible tasks exist, record status:completed with result:no_work_available instead of status:aborted. Currently 11/16 aborts are normal no-work exits, inflating abort rate to 69%.",
