        "_ulid": "01KHDX7PVVZJBEJ70MNWQ94CYD",
        "created_at": "2026-02-14T11:05:36.891Z",
        "author": "@claude",
        "content": "Implemented --tasks flag for explicit task scoping in ralph:\n\n- Added --tasks <refs> option to ralph run command (comma-separated refs like @task1,@task2)\n- parseExplicitTasks() validates refs and resolves to ULIDs\n- filterByExplicitTasks() filters session context to only include listed tasks\n- allExplicitTasksDone() checks if all explicit tasks are completed/blocked for loop exit\n- Updated buildTaskWorkPrompt() to include explicit task scope section in prompt\n- Updated dry-run output to show explicit-tasks configuration\n- Session start event logs explicitTasks array\n- When --tasks is used, automation eligibility is bypassed (can work on manual_only tasks)\n- Loop exits when all explicit tasks are completed or blocked\n\n14 tests covering:\n- ac-21: Basic flag acceptance, comma-separated refs, ULID/short ULID formats\n- Error handling for invalid refs and spec item refs\n- Prompt includes explicit scope indicator and updates mode description\n- Session event logging\n- manual_only tasks included when explicitly specified\n- Context filtering to only show explicit tasks\n- Loop exit on all tasks completed/blocked",
        "supersedes": null
      }
    ],
    "todos": [],
    "automation": "eligible",
    "_sourceFile": "/workspace/.kspec/project.tasks.yaml"
