  {
    "_ulid": "01KHAPA9MV1HJV32K6VGNQ38KA",
    "slugs": [
      "task-ralph-wrap-up-agent-on-loop-exit"
    ],
    "title": "Implement ralph wrap-up agent on loop exit",
    "type": "task",
    "spec_ref": "@01KHAP9PZ2WEMV9PRV037MC5Y8",
    "derivation": "auto",
    "status": "completed",
    "blocked_by": [],
    "closed_reason": "Merged in PR #369. Implemented ralph wrap-up agent that spawns on loop exit (all exit reasons: no_tasks, end_loop_signal, max_iterations, error, max_failures, explicit_tasks_done). Gathers working tree state (staged/unstaged/untracked), tasks, and session info. Builds focused prompt for subagent to handle cleanup (commit, stash, or flag for review). Runs with 2-minute timeout. All 5 ACs covered by 35 tests.",
    "depends_on": [
      "@task-ralph-command-automated-task-loop"
    ],
    "context": [],
    "priority": 3,
    "tags": [],
    "vcs_refs": [],
    "created_at": "2026-02-13T05:06:58.331Z",
    "started_at": "2026-02-14T11:15:07.945Z",
    "completed_at": "2026-02-14T11:37:36.006Z",
    "notes": [
      {
        "_ulid": "01KHAPA9MTAXSFZXGRC04G9E3P",
        "created_at": "2026-02-13T05:06:58.331Z",
        "author": "@claude",
        "content": "Implementation notes (auto-generated from spec):\n\nWhen the ralph loop exits for any reason (no eligible tasks, agent signaled end-loop, max iterations reached, error), spawn a final wrap-up subagent before terminating. The wrap-up agent ensures the workspace is in a clean state: uncommitted changes are identified and handled (committed, stashed, or flagged), stale markers are cleaned up, and a brief exit summary is produced. Runs as a subagent like PR review, with a focused prompt and short timeout.\n\n\nAcceptance Criteria:\n- ac-1: Given Ralph loop exits for any reason (no tasks, end-loop signal, max iterations, error), when exit sequence begins, then a wrap-up subagent is spawned before the process terminates\n- ac-2: Given Wrap-up agent starts, when it inspects the working tree, then identifies uncommitted changes (staged, unstaged, untracked) and reports what they appear to relate to (task refs, file patterns)\n- ac-3: Given Wrap-up agent finds uncommitted changes, when changes are present, then commits with appropriate message, stashes, or flags for human review depending on context; does not silently discard work\n- ac-4: Given Wrap-up agent completes, when cleanup is done, then produces a brief exit summary: what was cleaned up, final task states, any items flagged for human attention\n- ac-5: Given Wrap-up agent is running, when timeout is reached (default 2 minutes), then agent is terminated and ralph exits without wrap-up; wrap-up must not block shutdown indefinitely",
        "supersedes": null
      },
      {
        "_ulid": "01KHDY205J26300Y54TAA9NB2W",
        "created_at": "2026-02-14T11:19:58.386Z",
        "author": "@claude",
        "content": "Implemented ralph wrap-up agent on loop exit:\n\n- Added wrap-up.ts module with WrapUpContext, ExitReason types\n- buildWrapUpContext() gathers exit state (working tree, tasks, session info)\n- buildWrapUpPrompt() generates focused prompt for wrap-up agent\n- isWrapUpNeeded() determines if wrap-up should run (dirty tree, error, in-progress tasks)\n- runWrapUpAgent() spawns subagent with 2-minute timeout\n- Integrated into ralph.ts finally block - runs on all exits except dry-run\n- Added session.wrapup event type for audit logging\n- Tracks exit reason throughout loop (no_tasks, end_loop_signal, max_iterations, error, max_failures, explicit_tasks_done)\n\n35 tests covering:\n- ac-1: Wrap-up spawned on exit (all exit reasons handled)\n- ac-2: Working tree inspection (staged, unstaged, untracked reported)\n- ac-3: Prompt instructions for commit/stash/flag handling\n- ac-4: Exit summary instructions in prompt\n- ac-5: 2-minute timeout constant, timeout warning in prompt",
        "supersedes": null
      },
      {
        "_ulid": "01KHDZ0MKAFZY6SCT933DJ44JK",
        "created_at": "2026-02-14T11:36:42.346Z",
        "author": "Jacob Chapel",
        "content": "[RALPH SUBAGENT] Subagent timed out after 10 minutes",
        "supersedes": null
      }
    ],
    "todos": [],
    "automation": "eligible",
    "_sourceFile": "/workspace/.kspec/project.tasks.yaml"
