    "title": "Gate reflect phase on meaningful session work during ralph loop",
    "type": "task",
    "description": "Gate /reflect skill on session introspection: before running the full reflect workflow, check whether meaningful work was done during the session (tasks completed, PRs created, code changes). Skip reflection if the session had no substantive work — avoids the 19% workflow time spent on empty reflection chains (31 consecutive runs observed with no new insights). Skill-level change to the reflect skill, not a workflow change.",
    "spec_ref": null,
    "status": "completed",
    "blocked_by": [],
    "closed_reason": "Merged in PR #357. Added gating logic to the reflect skill's Loop Mode section - agent now checks session introspection data (recently_completed tasks, working_tree status, recent_commits) before starting reflection. If no meaningful session work detected, reflection is skipped to prevent wasted time on empty reflection runs.",
    "depends_on": [],
    "context": [],
    "priority": 3,
    "tags": [],
    "vcs_refs": [],
    "created_at": "2026-02-13T05:42:42.988Z",
    "started_at": "2026-02-14T03:18:13.462Z",
    "completed_at": "2026-02-14T03:28:21.762Z",
    "notes": [
      {
        "_ulid": "01KHARBR1FJEF3R0E4P8QZ8DP5",
        "created_at": "2026-02-13T05:42:42.991Z",
        "author": "@claude",
        "content": "During ralph loop, skip reflection if no substantive work done (no tasks completed, no PRs, no code changes). Data: 19% workflow time wasted on 31 consecutive empty reflection runs. Gate at the skill level — check session introspection before running full reflect workflow.",
        "supersedes": null
      },
      {
        "_ulid": "01KHD2KA3DMW2CSDFX4FMYYRVC",
        "created_at": "2026-02-14T03:20:05.485Z",
        "author": "@claude",
        "content": "Added gating logic to reflect skill's Loop Mode section. The skill now instructs the agent to check session introspection data (recently_completed tasks, working_tree status, recent_commits) BEFORE starting the reflection workflow. If no meaningful session work is detected (no tasks completed, no code changes, no commits), the agent outputs a skip message and exits immediately without starting the workflow. This prevents wasted time on empty reflection runs during ralph loops.",
        "supersedes": null
      }
    ],
