    "slugs": [],
    "title": "Extract drift detection field lists from Zod schemas at runtime",
    "type": "task",
    "description": "PR #362 hardcodes SPEC_ITEM_FIELDS and TASK_FIELDS as manually maintained Sets. These will drift from the actual Zod schemas — the exact problem the feature claims to detect. Fix: derive field sets from SpecItemSchema.shape and TaskSchema.shape at runtime. Also adds a CONCEPTUAL_FIELDS set of common English words (modules, features, requirements) that triggers false positives on natural prose.",
