        "content": "Implemented Skill CLI Commands:\n\n- ac-1: kspec skill list displays table with ID, Name, Origin, Version, Platforms columns\n- ac-2: kspec skill list --json returns JSON array with full skill metadata\n- ac-3: kspec skill add creates meta entry with origin (default: project)\n- ac-4: kspec skill add creates .kspec/skills/<id>/SKILL.md file\n- ac-5: kspec skill get displays metadata including id, name, origin, platforms\n- ac-6: kspec skill get displays SKILL.md content\n- ac-7: kspec skill delete --confirm removes meta entry from manifest\n- ac-8: kspec skill delete removes .kspec/skills/<id>/ directory\n\nAlso:\n- Changed --version to --skill-version to avoid conflict with CLI global --version flag\n- Added origin/tag filtering for skill list\n- Added dependency checking for skill delete (prevents deletion if other skills depend on it)\n\n29 tests covering all 8 ACs in tests/skill-cli.test.ts",
