        "content": "Implemented consolidation of skill render implementations:\n\n1. Moved hash/drift functions to skill-render.ts:\n   - computeContentHash, getRenderHashPath, readRenderHash, writeRenderHash, checkSkillDrift\n   - All exported from skill-render.ts (AC-3)\n\n2. Extended renderClaudeCodeSkill with storeHash option:\n   - When storeHash: true, renders and stores hash for drift detection\n   - CLI uses storeHash: true, setup.ts uses default (false) - maintains backward compatibility\n\n3. Updated CLI skill render command:\n   - Now imports and delegates to renderClaudeCodeSkill from skill-render.ts (AC-1)\n   - Removed private renderSkill function (AC-2)\n   - Removed ~200 lines of duplicate code\n\n4. Verified setup.ts still works correctly (AC-4)\n\n5. All 206 existing tests pass without modification (AC-5)",
