  {
    "_ulid": "01KHHQD64NTFBWFNCC2MDNHA4B",
    "slugs": [
      "implement-platform-renderer-contract"
    ],
    "title": "Implement Platform Renderer Contract",
    "type": "task",
    "spec_ref": "@platform-renderer-trait",
    "plan_ref": "@plan-multi-platform-skill-rendering-with-agent-skills-c",
    "status": "completed",
    "blocked_by": [],
    "closed_reason": "Merged in PR #395. Implemented Platform Renderer Contract:\n\n1. Defined PlatformRenderer interface with platform, defaultOutputDir, render(), and checkDrift() methods\n2. Defined PlatformRenderResult interface with id, platform, action, paths, supportingDirsAction, skipReason\n3. Defined DriftStatus type for drift detection\n4. Implemented supporting directories support (references/, scripts/, assets/, docs/)\n5. Implemented dryRun mode for preview without file writes\n6. Implemented custom outputDir support\n7. Implemented per-platform hash storage (.render-hash-<platform>)\n8. Created renderer registry with getRenderer(), getAllRenderers(), registerRenderer()\n\nAll 6 acceptance criteria covered by 33 tests in tests/platform-renderer.test.ts.",
    "depends_on": [
      "@implement-consolidate-skill-render-implementations"
    ],
    "context": [],
    "priority": 3,
    "tags": [],
    "vcs_refs": [],
    "created_at": "2026-02-15T22:40:42.645Z",
    "started_at": "2026-02-15T23:19:27.197Z",
    "completed_at": "2026-02-15T23:37:24.584Z",
    "notes": [
      {
        "_ulid": "01KHHQD64NK1J45WJTKNA8EE7G",
        "created_at": "2026-02-15T22:40:42.645Z",
        "author": "@claude",
        "content": "Implementation notes:\n\nThis trait defines the contract — it does NOT contain implementation code.\nThe TypeScript interface lives in src/parser/skill-render.ts:\n\ninterface PlatformRenderer {\n  platform: string;              // e.g. \"claude-code\", \"codex\"\n  defaultOutputDir: string;      // e.g. \".claude/skills\", \".agents/skills\"\n  render(ctx, projectRoot, skill, options): Promise<PlatformRenderResult>;\n  checkDrift(specDir, projectRoot, skillId, options): Promise<DriftStatus>;\n}\n\ninterface PlatformRenderResult {\n  id: string;\n  platform: string;\n  action: \"created\" | \"updated\" | \"unchanged\" | \"skipped\";\n  paths: string[];\n  supportingDirsAction?: Record<string, \"created\" | \"updated\" | \"unchanged\" | \"skipped\">;\n  skipReason?: string;\n}\n\ntype DriftStatus = \"not-rendered\" | \"in-sync\" | \"drifted\" | \"no-hash\";\n\nRenderer registry: Record<string, PlatformRenderer> with getRenderer(platform) and getAllRenderers().\n\nDepends on @consolidate-skill-render being done first so there's a single render module.\n"
      },
      {
        "_ulid": "01KHHT0Y94FVRR554GENAV57JX",
        "created_at": "2026-02-15T23:26:27.108Z",
        "author": "@claude",
        "content": "Implemented Platform Renderer Contract:\n\n1. Defined PlatformRenderer interface in skill-render.ts:\n   - platform: string identifier\n   - defaultOutputDir: string for default output path\n   - render(): creates platform-specific output files (AC-1)\n   - checkDrift(): detects drift using per-platform hashes (AC-6)\n\n2. Defined PlatformRenderResult interface (AC-2):\n   - id, platform, action, paths fields\n   - supportingDirsAction for tracking supporting directory actions\n   - skipReason for skipped renders\n\n3. Defined DriftStatus type: 'not-rendered' | 'in-sync' | 'drifted' | 'no-hash'\n\n4. Implemented supporting directories support (AC-3):\n   - references/, scripts/, assets/, docs/ all copied to output\n   - Action tracked per directory in supportingDirsAction\n\n5. Implemented dryRun mode (AC-4):\n   - No files written when dryRun: true\n   - Result still reflects what would happen\n\n6. Implemented custom outputDir support (AC-5):\n   - Overrides platform default when specified\n   - Works for both SKILL.md and supporting directories\n\n7. Implemented per-platform hash storage (AC-6):\n   - Writes to .render-hash-<platform> for platform-specific drift detection\n   - Also writes legacy .render-hash for backward compatibility\n\n8. Created renderer registry:\n   - getRenderer(platform): get renderer by name\n   - getAllRenderers(): get all registered renderers\n   - registerRenderer(renderer): add custom renderers\n\n9. Maintained backward compatibility:\n   - ClaudeCodeRenderResult still works (marked deprecated)\n   - RenderSkillOptions extended with outputDir\n   - Legacy hash fallback in readPlatformRenderHash\n\n33 new tests added in tests/platform-renderer.test.ts covering all 6 ACs.",
        "supersedes": null
      }
    ],
    "todos": [],
    "automation": "eligible",
    "_sourceFile": "/workspace/.kspec/project.tasks.yaml"
  },
