        "content": "Implemented Claude Code Renderer - Extended Frontmatter:\n\n1. Extended generateFrontmatter() to include:\n   - Portable fields: license, allowed-tools, compatibility (AC-1, AC-5)\n   - Claude Code platform fields: user-invocable, disable-model-invocation, context, agent, model, argument-hint (AC-2, AC-3, AC-4)\n   - All snake_case fields converted to kebab-case for Claude Code frontmatter (AC-8)\n\n2. Updated renderClaudeCodeSkill() to copy ALL supporting directories (references/, scripts/, assets/, docs/) instead of just docs/ (AC-7)\n\n3. Implemented hash migration in checkPlatformSkillDrift():\n   - migrateLegacyRenderHash() function migrates .render-hash to .render-hash-claude-code (AC-6)\n   - readPlatformRenderHash() falls back to legacy hash when platform-specific doesn't exist\n\nAdded 13 new tests covering all 8 ACs in tests/skill-rendering.test.ts:\n- ac-1: Portable fields (license, allowed-tools) in frontmatter (2 tests)\n- ac-2: user-invocable from platform_config (1 test)\n- ac-3: context and agent from platform_config (1 test)\n- ac-4: disable-model-invocation from platform_config (1 test)\n- ac-5: Only portable fields when no platform_config (1 test)\n- ac-6: Hash migration from .render-hash to .render-hash-claude-code (2 tests)\n- ac-7: Supporting directories (references/, scripts/, assets/) copied (3 tests)\n- ac-8: snake_case to kebab-case conversion in frontmatter (2 tests)\n\nAll 61 skill rendering tests pass.",
