        "content": "Implemented Skill Platform Config CLI with all 4 ACs:\n\n1. AC-1: --platform-config claude_code.key=value updates platform_config.claude_code in meta.yaml\n2. AC-2: --platform-config codex.key=value updates platform_config.codex in meta.yaml  \n3. AC-3: platform_config already included in JSON output (verified with test)\n4. AC-4: Validation errors show guidance on valid keys per platform (ClaudeCodeConfigSchema, CodexConfigSchema)\n\nFeatures:\n- Parses platform.key=value format\n- Converts true/false strings to booleans, otherwise string values\n- Deep merges into existing platform_config (doesn't replace entire object)\n- Multiple --platform-config options can be passed in single command\n- Schema validation catches invalid keys due to strict mode\n\nAdded 12 tests in tests/skill-cli.test.ts covering all ACs plus edge cases (deep merge, multiple platforms, invalid format).",
