        "author": "@claude",
        "content": "Implementation notes (auto-generated from spec):\n\nFix cross-platform parsing issues and version detection reliability so kspec works correctly on Windows and reliably detects when updates are needed.\n\n\nAcceptance Criteria:\n- ac-1: Given a SKILL.md file with CRLF line endings, when parseFrontmatter is called (in validate-skills.ts or skill.ts), then frontmatter is correctly parsed (handles both LF and CRLF)\n- ac-2: Given a SKILL.md file with CRLF line endings, when stripFrontmatter is called, then frontmatter is correctly stripped\n- ac-3: Given getKspecPackageVersion cannot resolve the package version, when skill install or update runs, then the version is reported as null or an error, not silently treated as a valid version string\n- ac-4: Given kspec-agents.md exists with a hash file, when kspec setup --status is run after skills or templates changed, then agents.md status is reported as stale (content hash comparison, not just hash file existence)\n- ac-5: Given a skill file with a base directory line, when normalizeBaseDirectory is called, then the line is matched case-insensitively and with common wording variations",
        "supersedes": null
      },
      {
        "_ulid": "01KHRX2Z627RN2X4879M74KD0M",
        "created_at": "2026-02-18T17:34:40.322Z",
        "author": "@claude",
        "content": "Implemented all 5 ACs:\n- AC-1/2: CRLF-safe frontmatter parsing/stripping in skill.ts and validate-skills.ts (regex updated to /^---\\r?\\n/)\n- AC-3: getKspecPackageVersion returns null instead of 'unknown', all 3 callers updated with conditional spread\n- AC-4: getSetupStatus now loads meta context and compares computeMetaHash against stored hash\n- AC-5: normalizeBaseDirectory regex now case-insensitive with for/of + optional 'this' wording\n- 14 new tests in cross-platform-robustness.test.ts, all passing\n- Full suite: 128/129 test files pass (1 pre-existing bun compile failure)\n- Added inbox note for skill-render.ts LF-only regex hardening follow-up",
        "supersedes": null
      }
    ],
    "todos": [],
    "_sourceFile": "/workspace/.kspec/project.tasks.yaml"
