        "created_at": "2026-02-19T02:48:16.999Z",
        "author": "@claude",
        "content": "Completed all 4 items:\n1. ac-1: Guard script now strips quoted strings before matching dangerous patterns — echo \"git reset\" no longer blocked\n2. ac-2: Replaced hand-rolled generateUnifiedDiff with diff library's createTwoFilesPatch — fixes cascade bug on insertions\n3. ac-3 (task note): Converted getKspecPackageVersion, loadCoreSkillsManifest, loadCoreSkillContent from readFileSync to async readFile. Updated all callers in setup.ts, skill-install.ts. Also converted getKspecVersion in export/json.ts.\n4. ac-4 (task note): Added structuredClone before mutation in skill-crud.ts (skill set) and skill-install.ts (skill update) to prevent partial-save corruption.\n\nNew test added: tests/skill-diff.test.ts for ac-2, plus guard execution test in enhanced-setup.test.ts for ac-1.",
        "supersedes": null
      }
    ],
