        "content": "Audit complete. Found: (1) findMetaItemByRef in parser/meta.ts (already exported, returns LoadedMetaItem | undefined); (2) resolveMetaRefToUlid local to meta.ts (returns {ulid, type}); (3) 15+ inline .find() lookups in meta.ts duplicating logic. Solution: Create resolveMetaRef in parser/meta.ts that returns {item, type, ulid} and use it everywhere, eliminating the local resolveMetaRefToUlid and inline lookups.",
