        "created_at": "2026-02-20T00:37:58.939Z",
        "author": "@claude",
        "content": "Implementation complete. Changes:\n1. Added resolveMetaRef() in parser/meta.ts - unified resolver returning {item, type, ulid}\n2. Added MetaItemTypeName and ResolvedMetaRef types\n3. Refactored findMetaItemByRef to use resolveMetaRef internally\n4. Updated meta.ts resolveMetaRefToUlid to use resolveMetaRef (now just a thin wrapper)\n5. Updated meta get command to use resolveMetaRef (removed ~40 lines of inline lookups)\n6. Updated meta set command to use resolveMetaRef (removed ~30 lines of inline lookups)\n7. Updated meta delete command to use resolveMetaRef (removed ~40 lines of inline lookups)\n8. Updated meta promote command to use resolveMetaRef (removed ~10 lines of inline lookups)\n9. Added 9 new tests for resolveMetaRef in skill-meta-type.test.ts\nAll 2824 tests pass.",
