        "content": "Implementation complete. Created src/parser/config.ts with:\n- KspecConfigSchema (Zod) for kspec.config.yaml validation\n- loadProjectConfig() loads from git root, handles invalid YAML gracefully\n- resolveConfig() applies env var precedence (KSPEC_AUTHOR, KSPEC_DAEMON_PORT, KSPEC_DAEMON_HOST)\n- findProjectRoot() handles KSPEC_BATCH_PROJECT_ROOT for batch mode\n\nUpdated yaml.ts initContext() to load config before shadow detection and include on KspecContext.\n\nUpdated batch-exec.ts to set KSPEC_BATCH_PROJECT_ROOT before redirecting KSPEC_SPEC_DIR.\n\n24 tests in tests/parser/config.test.ts covering all 7 ACs. All 2848 tests pass.",
