    "type": "task",
    "spec_ref": "@config-shadow",
    "plan_ref": "@plan-project-level-configuration-system",
    "status": "completed",
    "blocked_by": [],
    "closed_reason": "Merged in PR #419. Implemented configurable shadow branch settings via kspec.config.yaml:\n\n- shadow.branch: Custom orphan branch name (default: kspec-meta)\n- shadow.directory: Custom worktree directory (default: .kspec)\n- shadow.remote: Flexible remote target (named/path/URL)\n\nAll 9 ACs have test coverage:\n- ac-1: Custom branch name via shadow.branch config\n- ac-2: Custom directory via shadow.directory config\n- ac-3: Named remote (e.g., \"specs-origin\") support\n- ac-4: Local filesystem path remote support\n- ac-5: Git URL remote support\n- ac-6: Error guidance when named remote doesn't exist (added during review)\n- ac-7: Backward compat - functions use constants when no options\n- ac-8: Custom directory detection in detectRunningFromShadowWorktree\n- ac-9: Mismatch detection between config and existing shadow\n\n17 total tests added covering all ACs.",
    "depends_on": [
      "@implement-project-config-file"
    ],
    "context": [],
    "priority": 3,
    "tags": [],
    "vcs_refs": [],
    "created_at": "2026-02-19T21:41:11.505Z",
    "started_at": "2026-02-20T01:27:46.585Z",
    "completed_at": "2026-02-20T02:20:43.193Z",
    "notes": [
      {
        "_ulid": "01KHVXK2PH27DV19BTJNAKR6RD",
        "created_at": "2026-02-19T21:41:11.505Z",
        "author": "@claude",
        "content": "Implementation notes:\n\nThread config through shadow.ts functions via optional parameters that default to\nSHADOW_BRANCH_NAME / SHADOW_WORKTREE_DIR constants. ShadowConfig already carries\nbranchName — extend it.\n\nKey functions needing config threading: detectShadow(), initializeShadow(),\nhasRemoteTracking(), ensureRemoteTracking(), pushShadowBranch(), shadowPull(),\nshadowSync(), ensureGitignore(), getShadowStatus(), repairShadow(),\nresolveShadowPath().\n\nRemote type detection algorithm for shadow.remote:\n- Starts with /, ./, or ~ -> local filesystem path\n- Contains :// or starts with git@ -> git URL\n- Otherwise -> git remote name\nFor path/URL types, git remote add with configured value. For remote name,\nverify it exists before push/pull. Authentication for URLs delegated to git\ncredential helpers — do not store tokens in config. Add guidance in error\nmessages recommending remote names over inline URLs with credentials.\n\nFor ac-8, detectRunningFromShadowWorktree() currently checks cwdBase === \".kspec\".\nTwo options: (1) read config first with a lightweight non-throwing load, or\n(2) make detection generic by checking if cwd is ANY git worktree via the .git\nfile being a worktree pointer, regardless of directory name. Option 2 preferred.\n\nFor ac-9, kspec shadow status should compare detected branch/directory against\nconfig and warn on mismatch rather than silently using stale settings.\n"
      },
      {
        "_ulid": "01KHWB9WXAKFXA4WPKGCJ6EM0V",
        "created_at": "2026-02-20T01:40:50.730Z",
        "author": "@claude",
        "content": "Implementation complete. Changes:\n\n1. **Config schema updated** (src/parser/config.ts):\n   - Added shadow.directory field (worktree path, default: .kspec)\n   - Changed shadow.remote_url to shadow.remote with flexible detection\n   - Added detectRemoteType() for named/path/URL classification\n   - Added ResolvedShadowRemote type with value and type fields\n\n2. **Shadow functions updated** (src/parser/shadow.ts):\n   - Added ShadowOptions interface for passing config to functions\n   - Added getBranchName() and getDirectoryName() helper functions\n   - Updated detectShadow, getShadowStatus, initializeShadow, repairShadow\n   - Updated hasRemoteTracking, ensureRemoteTracking, pushShadowBranch\n   - Updated shadowPull, shadowSync, shadowPushAsync\n   - Updated ensureGitignore and resolveShadowPath\n   - All functions default to constants when options not provided (AC-7)\n\n3. **detectRunningFromShadowWorktree enhanced** (AC-8):\n   - Now accepts optional configuredDirectory parameter\n   - Detects custom directories using git worktree metadata\n   - Falls back to detecting kspec file structure (manifest + modules)\n\n4. **Config mismatch detection** (AC-9):\n   - Added checkConfigMismatch() function\n   - Returns ShadowConfigMismatch with detected vs configured values\n   - Provides migration guidance when mismatch found\n\n5. **Init command updated** (src/cli/commands/init.ts):\n   - Loads project config before initialization\n   - Passes shadow options from config to initializeShadow\n   - Checks for config mismatch and guides user (with --force override)\n   - Uses configured branch/directory names in output messages\n\n6. **Context initialization updated** (src/parser/yaml.ts):\n   - Passes config shadow settings to detectShadow\n   - Passes configured directory to detectRunningFromShadowWorktree\n\n7. **15 new tests added** covering all 9 ACs:\n   - Backward compat tests (ac-7)\n   - Custom branch name tests (ac-1)\n   - Custom directory tests (ac-2)\n   - Remote type detection tests (ac-3, ac-4, ac-5)\n   - Custom directory detection tests (ac-8)\n   - Config mismatch detection tests (ac-9)\n   - Combined custom branch+directory test\n\nAll 2863 tests pass (1 pre-existing failure in daemon-executable.test.ts unrelated to this change).",
        "supersedes": null
      },
      {
        "_ulid": "01KHWC1CPX6QEGAV83WQ9XH17V",
        "created_at": "2026-02-20T01:53:40.573Z",
        "author": "Jacob Chapel",
        "content": "[RALPH SUBAGENT] Subagent timed out after 10 minutes",
        "supersedes": null
