    "closed_reason": "Merged in PR #420. Implemented configurable validation defaults via kspec.config.yaml:\n\n- validation.strict_refs: When false, dangling refs are warnings instead of errors (default: true)\n- validation.require_acceptance: When true, missing AC is an error instead of warning (default: false)\n- CLI --strict flag continues to override config for orphans/staleness\n\nAll 4 ACs covered with annotated tests (7 tests in validate-config.test.ts):\n- ac-1: require_acceptance promotes missing AC to errors\n- ac-2: strict_refs treats dangling refs as errors\n- ac-3: strict_refs: false treats dangling refs as warnings  \n- ac-4: CLI --strict overrides config strict_refs: false",
    "depends_on": [
