  {
    "_ulid": "01KJ19D0CH3SECG4FT9GQ46S10",
    "slugs": [
      "task-plugin-rendering"
    ],
    "title": "Migrate skill rendering to Claude Code plugin system",
    "type": "task",
    "description": "Claude Code does not support nested skill directories (.claude/skills/kspec/<id>/ is NOT discovered). The official namespacing mechanism is the plugin system.\n\n## Goal\n\nRender kspec core skills as a Claude Code plugin so they are properly namespaced and discovered. For non-Claude platforms (Codex, etc.), use flat prefix naming since they lack plugins.\n\n### Claude Code target structure\n.claude/plugins/kspec/.claude-plugin/plugin.json (name, version, description)\n.claude/plugins/kspec/skills/help/SKILL.md -> invoked as /kspec:help\n\n### Non-Claude target structure\n.agents/skills/kspec-help/SKILL.md (flat prefix)\n\n## Key Implementation Points\n\n### Path construction (3 strategic functions in skill-render.ts)\n- getSkillSubdir() - currently adds kspec/ prefix for core skills on claude-code\n- getRenderedSkillPath() - constructs full output path\n- getPlatformDefaultOutputDir() - returns .claude/skills for claude-code\n- claudeCodeRenderer defaultOutputDir needs to change for core skills\n\n### Plugin manifest generation\n- Generate .claude/plugins/kspec/.claude-plugin/plugin.json during skill render\n- Include kspec version, description\n\n### Migration\n- Remove old .claude/skills/kspec/ directory (monolithic skill + broken nested renders)\n- skill render --clean needs to handle old to new path transition\n- Similar pattern to PR #440 migration logic\n\n### Non-Claude platforms\n- Codex renderer uses .agents/skills/ (flat) - use kspec-<id> prefix instead of nesting\n- Other future platforms: same flat prefix approach\n\n### Files affected (from codebase exploration)\n- src/parser/skill-render.ts - core path logic, PlatformRenderer, claudeCodeRenderer\n- src/cli/commands/skill-diff.ts - render/status/diff/verify commands\n- src/cli/commands/setup.ts - getSetupStatus() directory scanning\n- src/parser/validate-skills.ts - findSkillFiles() directory discovery\n- 14 test suites with path assertions\n\n### What already exists\n- templates/skills/help/SKILL.md - lean CLI map content ready for plugin rendering\n- templates/skills/manifest.yaml - core skills manifest\n- PlatformRenderer interface is well-abstracted\n\n### Also resolve\n- Existing monolithic .claude/skills/kspec/SKILL.md (591 lines) replaced by plugin-rendered skills\n- kspec-agents.md Finding Information table should show /kspec:help after migration (fix generateSkillsTable in agent-data-sections.ts)",
    "spec_ref": null,
    "meta_ref": null,
    "plan_ref": null,
    "status": "completed",
    "blocked_by": [],
    "closed_reason": "Merged in PR #442. Core skills now render to .claude/plugins/kspec/skills/<id>/ for proper Claude Code plugin discovery as /kspec:<id>.",
    "depends_on": [],
    "context": [],
    "priority": 2,
    "tags": [
      "core-skills",
      "plugins",
      "platform"
    ],
    "vcs_refs": [],
    "created_at": "2026-02-21T23:43:47.601Z",
    "started_at": "2026-02-21T23:56:39.092Z",
    "completed_at": "2026-02-22T01:37:33.612Z",
    "notes": [
      {
        "_ulid": "01KJ1A326HT5QZJ9AVXTGRDH21",
        "created_at": "2026-02-21T23:55:50.353Z",
        "author": "@claude",
        "content": "NOTE: PR #440 namespace rendering (.claude/skills/kspec/<id>/) is also broken — Claude Code does not discover nested skill dirs. Plugin migration must clean up the merged PR #440 output structure too, not just the attempted help skill rename.",
        "supersedes": null
