      {
        "_ulid": "01KJ1C8WW2YPZGCTMFE3ZKVDMD",
        "created_at": "2026-02-22T00:33:58.658Z",
        "author": "@claude",
        "content": "Implementation complete. All code changes done and verified:\n\n1. **skill-render.ts**: Added PLUGIN_DIR/PLUGIN_SKILLS_DIR constants. getSkillSubdir() returns just skillId for core+claude-code (plugin provides namespace), kspec-<id> for core+codex. getRenderedSkillPath() routes core→plugin dir. claudeCodeRenderer renders core to plugin dir, cleans 3 old path formats, generates plugin manifest. codexRenderer uses kspec-<id> subdir. Both drift checkers updated.\n\n2. **agent-data-sections.ts**: Core skills invoked as /kspec:<id>, project as /<id>.\n\n3. **validate-skills.ts**: Scans .claude/plugins/*/skills/ for SKILL.md files.\n\n4. **setup-status.ts & setup.ts**: Both scan plugin dirs for skill counts.\n\n5. **skill-diff.ts**: Status/diff/clean all use correct paths. Clean scans plugin dir + migrates old .claude/skills/kspec/ remnants.\n\n6. **Tests**: core-skill-namespace (15 tests), supporting-files-convention (12), agent-data-sections (28) — all pass. 159 related tests pass total.\n\n7. **Spec**: @skill-rendering ac-7 updated to reference plugin path.\n\n8. **Verified**: kspec skill render/status/clean/validate all work correctly. kspec-agents.md shows /kspec:kspec-help.",
        "supersedes": null
