      {
        "_ulid": "01KJ3FXHDHXHD05K28G8JQXVWX",
        "created_at": "2026-02-22T20:16:09.649Z",
        "author": "@claude",
        "content": "Implementation notes:\n\nCreate src/schema/triage.ts following plan.ts pattern.\nTriageStatusSchema = z.enum([\"pending\", \"triaged\", \"acted_on\"]).\nTriageActionSchema = z.enum([\"promote\", \"delete\", \"defer\", \"spec-gap\", \"duplicate\"]).\nInclude updated_at field set on any mutation.\nEnforce inbox_ref uniqueness in save logic (upsert pattern).\nAdd load/save in src/parser/yaml.ts: getTriageFilePath, loadTriageRecords, saveTriageRecord.\n"
      },
      {
        "_ulid": "01KJ3GA0ENHKF8G4J83AFESZ0V",
        "created_at": "2026-02-22T20:22:58.261Z",
        "author": "@claude",
        "content": "Implemented schema and parser layer:\n\n**Schema (src/schema/triage.ts):**\n- TriageStatusSchema: pending | triaged | acted_on\n- TriageActionSchema: promote | delete | defer | spec-gap | duplicate\n- TriageRecordSchema: full record with decision, override, and execution fields\n- TriageRecordInputSchema: input variant for creation\n- TriageFileSchema: collection format with kynetic_triage version string\n\n**Parser (src/parser/yaml.ts):**\n- getTriageFilePath(ctx) — returns project.triage.yaml path\n- loadTriageRecords(ctx) — loads and validates triage records\n- saveTriageRecord(ctx, record) — upsert by ULID or inbox_ref, sets updated_at\n- findTriageRecordByRef(records, ref) — lookup by ULID/short ULID\n- findTriageRecordByInboxRef(records, inboxRef) — lookup by inbox item reference\n\n**Tests (38 passing):**\n- tests/triage-schema.test.ts — 21 tests covering all 9 ACs\n- tests/triage-parser.test.ts — 17 tests covering load/save/find operations\n\nAll ACs covered. Full test suite green (3 pre-existing failures unrelated).",
        "supersedes": null
      }
    ],
    "todos": [],
    "_sourceFile": "/workspace/.kspec/project.tasks.yaml"
  },
