    "closed_reason": "Merged in PR #449. Implements all 7 triage CLI commands (record, list, act, override, export, start, get) with full own AC coverage (17/17) and comprehensive trait AC coverage across 6 traits (json-output, error-guidance, semantic-exit-codes, filterable-list, shadow-commit, dry-run). 52 tests passing. Fix cycle 2 resolved all previous review findings.",
