    "_ulid": "01KJ3SMTMK0VXV8N9SR3G0BMKT",
    "slugs": [
      "task-fix-daemon-executable-build"
    ],
    "title": "Fix daemon-executable bun build --compile failure",
    "type": "task",
    "description": "bun build --compile fails for the daemon package because route files use relative imports to parent packages (../../parser/index.js, ../../utils/grep.js, ../../parser/shadow.js). Bun's bundler cannot resolve these cross-package ESM imports.\n\nAffected route files:\n- packages/daemon/src/routes/items.ts (line 26)\n- packages/daemon/src/routes/validation.ts (lines 26, 33)\n- packages/daemon/src/routes/meta.ts (line 22)\n- packages/daemon/src/routes/tasks.ts (lines 30, 31)\n- packages/daemon/src/routes/inbox.ts (lines 27, 28)\n\nTest: tests/daemon-executable.test.ts - first test fails with exit code 1 (expected 0).\nInbox item: 01KHHJ27CE4SNQXCZDZRJCFK4M\nSpec: @daemon-server ac-16\n\nPossible approaches:\n1. Configure Bun bundler with proper package resolution/externals\n2. Use workspace package imports (e.g., kynetic-spec/parser) instead of relative paths\n3. Add a pre-build step that resolves/bundles parent package dependencies\n\nThe underlying issue is the monorepo structure - daemon lives in packages/daemon/ but imports from src/ at the repo root via relative paths.",
    "spec_ref": null,
    "meta_ref": null,
    "plan_ref": null,
    "status": "completed",
    "blocked_by": [],
    "closed_reason": "Merged in PR #452. Fixed bun build --compile failure by changing the compile source from packages/daemon/src/index.ts to dist/daemon/index.ts where cross-package relative imports resolve correctly. All 3 daemon-executable tests pass. AC @daemon-server ac-16 covered.",
    "depends_on": [],
    "context": [],
    "priority": 3,
    "tags": [
      "bug",
      "daemon",
      "infra"
    ],
    "vcs_refs": [],
    "created_at": "2026-02-22T23:06:09.939Z",
    "started_at": "2026-02-23T00:12:45.839Z",
    "completed_at": "2026-02-23T00:31:47.028Z",
    "notes": [
      {
        "_ulid": "01KJ3SS53VD4G4TCCVAS8FJWHF",
        "created_at": "2026-02-22T23:08:31.739Z",
        "author": "@claude",
        "content": "Automation eligible. This should be fixable by an agent — the root cause is well-documented (cross-package relative imports). If no fix is found after multiple attempts, block for manual handling.",
        "supersedes": null
      },
      {
        "_ulid": "01KJ3XTE1JQSJ5KGM5TEG8X1E1",
        "created_at": "2026-02-23T00:19:07.954Z",
        "author": "@claude",
        "content": "Root cause: bun build --compile was running from packages/daemon/ and trying to resolve relative imports (../../parser/index.js) which pointed outside the package to non-existent paths. Fix: Changed build:compile to compile from dist/daemon/index.ts (populated by npm run build:daemon) where the relative import paths correctly resolve to dist/parser/ and dist/utils/. Updated daemon package.json, build-executables.sh, and test. All 3 daemon-executable tests now pass. Full suite: 3105 passed, 1 failed (pre-existing doctor flaky test).",
        "supersedes": null
      }
    ],
    "todos": [],
    "automation": "eligible",
    "_sourceFile": "/workspace/.kspec/project.tasks.yaml"
  },
