        "author": "@claude",
        "content": "Root cause: getDaemonStatus() checks global PID file (~/.config/kspec/daemon.pid), not per-project. Tests asserting 'daemon not running' behavior failed when a real daemon was running on the host (e.g. during ralph loop sessions). Fix: Added vi.spyOn mocking of getDaemonStatus in 3 tests (ac-daemon-running, ac-daemon-not-running x2) to isolate from host environment, matching the pattern already used in the ac-daemon-unreachable test. Two consecutive full suite runs (3168 tests) pass cleanly.",
