        "created_at": "2026-02-26T00:29:14.640Z",
        "author": "@claude",
        "content": "AUDIT RESTRUCTURED — Original 4 tasks deleted, replaced with 10 properly-scoped tasks:\n\nE2E REPLACEMENT TASKS (9 tasks, P2):\n- @task-e2e-daemon-tasks-api — replace daemon-api-tasks.test.ts (258 lines, @api-contract ac-2 through ac-7)\n- @task-e2e-daemon-items-api — replace daemon-api-items.test.ts (217 lines, @api-contract ac-8 through ac-11)\n- @task-e2e-daemon-inbox-api — replace daemon-api-inbox.test.ts (218 lines, @api-contract ac-12 through ac-14)\n- @task-e2e-daemon-meta-validation-api — replace daemon-api-meta.test.ts + daemon-api-validation.test.ts (390 lines, @api-contract ac-15 through ac-21)\n- @task-e2e-daemon-triage-api — replace daemon-api-triage.test.ts (414 lines, @triage-daemon-api ac-1 through ac-9)\n- @task-e2e-daemon-errors-projects-api — replace daemon-api-error-handling.test.ts + daemon-api-projects.test.ts (383 lines, @api-contract ac-22-24, @multi-directory-daemon ac-28-30)\n- @task-e2e-daemon-server-core — replace daemon-server.test.ts static parts (310 lines, @daemon-server ac-11,15, @api-contract ac-1)\n- @task-e2e-daemon-websocket — replace daemon-websocket.test.ts (591 lines, @api-contract ac-25-33, @trait-websocket-protocol)\n- @task-e2e-daemon-watcher — replace daemon-watcher.test.ts (163 lines, @daemon-server ac-4-6)\n\nDELETION TASK (1 task, P2):\n- @task-delete-static-analysis-tests — delete skill-module-split, web-ui-shared-types, web-ui-triage, plus partial cleanup of end-loop, normalize-ref-input, package-distribution\n\nKey decisions:\n- All daemon API tests become Playwright E2E hitting real daemon (not vitest static analysis)\n- skill-module-split tests deleted entirely (one-time refactoring outcome, not ongoing behavior)\n- web-ui-shared-types deleted (convention enforcement, not behavior)\n- normalize-ref-input anti-pattern scanning deleted (not worth ESLint rule)\n- Ralph absence tests (removed markers) kept — static scanning IS the right tool for absence checks\n- Localhost middleware unit tests kept — already behavioral",
