  {
    "_ulid": "01KJ65J2Q0SS2WGYD1P5FZ2C40",
    "slugs": [],
    "title": "Fix phased tool call event handling for ralph display and session stats",
    "type": "bug",
    "description": "## Problem\n\nAfter upgrading to @agentclientprotocol/sdk@0.14.x, tool call info (command names, file paths, etc.) is no longer displayed in ralph loop output. Only the tool result/output is shown.\n\n## Root Cause\n\nThe ACP SDK now sends tool calls in two phases:\n1. `tool_call` event with `rawInput: {}` (empty) and `status: pending`\n2. `tool_call_update` event moments later with populated `rawInput: { command: \"...\", description: \"...\" }`\n\nThe event translator in events.ts extracts the summary on the first event (gets empty string from empty rawInput), then when the second event arrives with populated input, the logic at line 648 doesn't always re-emit a tool_update with the now-available summary.\n\n## Affected Code (comprehensive list)\n\n### Core translator (primary fix)\n- **src/ralph/events.ts lines 632-683** (`tool_call` case): Summary extraction from empty rawInput yields \"\". Need to handle phased arrival — when tool_call_update arrives with populated rawInput and existing summary was empty, emit a tool_update event with the summary.\n- **src/ralph/events.ts line 648**: The check `if (summary && !hadSummary)` — needs to correctly detect \"summary was empty before, now has content\"\n- **src/ralph/events.ts lines 685-738** (`tool_call_update` case): May need to also check for newly-available summary here, not just in the tool_call case\n\n### CLI renderer (may need adjustment)\n- **src/ralph/cli-renderer.ts lines 175-198** (`renderToolStart`): Currently shows empty summary on first event. Should either defer display until summary available, or update display when summary arrives via tool_update\n- **src/ralph/cli-renderer.ts lines 200-211** (`renderToolUpdate`): Should display summary when it arrives in the update phase\n\n### Session stats (double-counting bug)\n- **src/sessions/store.ts lines 979-1028** (`computeToolUsageStats`): Counts BOTH phased events as separate tool calls, leading to doubled tool usage stats. Must deduplicate by toolCallId — only count unique tool calls, not phased updates\n- **src/sessions/store.ts lines 455-484** (`countTaskCompletions`): Accesses `rawInput.command` — safe since first event has empty rawInput (won't false-match), but should be verified\n\n### Session display\n- **src/cli/commands/session.ts lines 1508-1556** (`summarizeEventData`): Shows tool_call events — first phased event will show only tool name without command details. Should either skip events with empty rawInput or prefer the populated version\n- **src/cli/commands/session.ts lines 1646-1737** (`sessionLogShowAction`): Displays events, may show tool twice (once per phase)\n- **src/cli/commands/session.ts lines 1856-1924** (`sessionLogStatsAction`): Uses computeToolUsageStats — inherits double-counting bug\n- **src/cli/commands/session.ts lines 1992-2027** (`sessionLogSearchAction`): Searches events, may find duplicate matches for phased events\n\n### Iteration summaries\n- **src/sessions/store.ts lines 718-802** (`computeIterationSummaries`): Extracts task start/complete refs from rawInput.command at lines 780-789 — only works when rawInput populated (second event), which is correct but should be documented\n\n## Test Coverage Needed\n\n### Existing tests to update\n- **tests/session-log-stats.test.ts lines 187-210**: Tests computeToolUsageStats with single events only — need phased event pair tests to verify no double-counting\n- **tests/ralph.test.ts**: Tests event translation — need phased tool_call event pairs\n\n### New tests needed\n- Phased tool_call → tool_call (with input) → tool_call_update (completed) flow through translator\n- Tool usage stats with phased events (verify count = 1, not 2)\n- CLI renderer output for phased events (summary appears on update, not on empty start)\n- Session log show/search with phased events (no duplicates)\n\n## Fix Approach\n\n1. **Translator (events.ts)**: When a tool_call or tool_call_update arrives with populated rawInput for a toolCallId whose existing summary is empty, extract the new summary and emit a tool_update event\n2. **Stats (store.ts)**: Deduplicate tool_call events by toolCallId — track seen IDs and only count first occurrence\n3. **Session display (session.ts)**: Filter or merge phased events so display shows one entry per tool call with full details\n4. **Tests**: Add phased event fixtures and assertions across all affected test files",
    "spec_ref": null,
    "meta_ref": null,
    "plan_ref": null,
    "status": "completed",
    "blocked_by": [],
    "closed_reason": "PR #485 merged by @chapel. Fix handles phased tool call events from ACP SDK 0.14+: translator extracts summary from tool_call_update, stats deduplicate by toolCallId, session display filters phased duplicates.",
    "depends_on": [],
    "context": [],
    "priority": 2,
    "tags": [
      "ralph",
      "events",
      "acp"
    ],
    "vcs_refs": [],
