    "description": "After the skill porting effort, .claude/skills/ still contains old versions of skills that were rewritten as core skills in templates/skills/. These should be removed.\n\nDuplicates (exist in both .claude/skills/ and templates/skills/):\n- create-workflow — ported to kspec:create-workflow\n- reflect — ported to kspec:reflect\n- task-work — ported to kspec:task-work\n\nRenamed/replaced (old name in .claude/skills/, new core version in templates/skills/):\n- meta → kspec:observations\n- spec → kspec:writing-specs\n- spec-plan → kspec:plan\n\nAction: Remove the 6 obsolete skills from .claude/skills/. Verify no references remain in settings.json, CLAUDE.md, or other config. Confirm core versions fully cover functionality before deleting.",
