        "content": "Added multi-harness env injection for Gemini CLI and OpenCode. Gemini CLI: writes to .gemini/.env in project root (auto-loaded by Gemini CLI). OpenCode: writes to project root .env (auto-loaded by Bun runtime). Both use a shared upsertDotenvSessionId() helper that replaces existing KSPEC_SESSION_ID lines or appends new ones. Updated performEnvInjection() routing to detect GEMINI_CLI=1 and OPENCODE_CONFIG_DIR/OPENCODE_CONFIG env vars. Updated EnvInjectionResult method type. 8 new tests (3 Gemini, 3 OpenCode library, 2 CLI integration). Also updated existing CLI fallback tests to clear new env vars. All other harnesses (Cline, Aider, Copilot, Amp) fall through to the existing export fallback since they lack config-based env injection mechanisms.",
