        "content": "Fixed two locations:\n1. detectTaskCompleteCommand() in ralph.ts: regex now matches both 'kspec task complete' and 'kspec task submit' via alternation pattern\n2. getIterationStats() in session.ts: now counts pending_review tasks (using started_at >= since) in addition to completed tasks (using completed_at >= since)\nExported detectTaskCompleteCommand for proper unit testing. Updated tests: replaced placeholder expect(true) with real assertions, updated iteration stats test to verify submitted tasks count toward limit. Updated spec ac-detection to reflect submit counting.",
