      {
        "_ulid": "01KJ74T8SBYPVEJWW687NGC388",
        "created_at": "2026-02-24T06:19:05.899Z",
        "author": "@claude",
        "content": "Implementation notes:\n\nCompute reverse dependency map over non-completed tasks.\nUse pattern from ralph.ts:601 for slug resolution: task.slugs[0] fallback to short ULID.\nStore in computed.task_unlocks as Record<string, number> keyed by ref (short ULID).\n"
      },
      {
        "_ulid": "01KJ8T161X5TSV0NBN957RJN1A",
        "created_at": "2026-02-24T21:49:07.005Z",
        "author": "@claude",
        "content": "Implemented 'unlocks N' annotation for session start output. Added computeUnlocksMap() that builds a reverse dependency map using ReferenceIndex — for each non-completed/cancelled task, resolves its depends_on refs and increments the count for the dependency target. Unresolvable refs are silently skipped per ac-unlocks-unresolvable. Added unlocks field to ReadyTaskSummary and BlockedTaskSummary types. Rendering shows green 'unlocks N' text when N>0, omitted when zero. 9 integration tests covering all 3 ACs: JSON + human output for ready/blocked tasks, zero omission, completed dependents excluded, and unresolvable ref handling via injected YAML with bogus ref.",
        "supersedes": null
      }
    ],
    "todos": [],
