        "author": "@claude",
        "content": "Implementation notes:\n\nAdd computed key to SessionContext interface:\n\ninterface SessionContextComputed {\n  inbox_untriaged_count: number;\n  inbox_deferred_count: number;\n  inbox_total: number;\n  task_unlocks: Record<string, number>;\n  recent_activity: ActivityItem[];\n}\n\ninterface ActivityItem {\n  type: \"task_completed\" | \"commit\";\n  timestamp: string;\n  task_ref?: string;\n  task_slug?: string | null;\n  task_title?: string;\n  close_reason?: string;\n  commit_hash?: string;\n  commit_message?: string;\n  commit_author?: string;\n  linked_task_ref?: string;\n}\n\nWire into gatherSessionContext() after unlocks, activity, and triage data are gathered.\nRaw arrays (recently_completed, recent_commits) stay unchanged.\ncomputed is additive — no existing JSON fields modified.\n\nKey file: src/cli/commands/session.ts",
        "supersedes": null
