    "notes": [
      {
        "_ulid": "01KJ7559QEJ2JZCNHXYR2V5CPF",
        "created_at": "2026-02-24T06:25:07.310Z",
        "author": "@claude",
        "content": "Implementation notes:\n\nKey file: src/cli/commands/session.ts (formatSessionContext() starting ~line 814)\nAlso update: src/strings/labels.ts (sessionHeaders)\n\nData model changes (additive only on existing interfaces):\n\nActiveTaskSummary — add: slug: string | null, description: string | null\nReadyTaskSummary — add: slug: string | null, description: string | null, unlocks: number\nBlockedTaskSummary — add: slug: string | null, description: string | null, unlocks: number\nCompletedTaskSummary — add: slug: string | null\nInboxSummary — add: triaged: boolean, triage_action: string | null\nCommitSummary — add: body: string | null, task_ref: string | null\n\nref stays as short ULID — no breaking change. Slug display is human output only.\n\nSection ordering: active → review → blocked → ready → activity → inbox → working tree → quick commands\nEmpty sections: skip entirely (no header, no placeholder)\nPrimer (default): top 5 ready, 10 activity items, inbox stat line only\nFull (--full): all ready, 20 activity, up to 20 untriaged inbox items, observations, session metadata\n--brief: alias for primer (no-op backward compat)\nneeds_work: visually distinct from in_progress (different status label/color)\nActive tasks: show title, description, recent notes (richest detail)\nReview tasks: show title and recent notes\nSlug display: @slug when available, @short-ulid fallback. Inbox always @short-ulid.\nTimestamps: relative in human output (2h ago), ISO 8601 in JSON.\n\nVerify ralph filterByExplicitTasks() unchanged (ref is still short ULID).",
        "supersedes": null
      },
      {
        "_ulid": "01KJ93K7RS2JHR3R6DXYWH4JJC",
        "created_at": "2026-02-25T00:36:15.769Z",
        "author": "@claude",
        "content": "Rewrote formatSessionContext() for primer/full modes. Changes: (1) Added slug, description, status fields to ActiveTaskSummary, ReadyTaskSummary, BlockedTaskSummary, CompletedTaskSummary. (2) New section ordering: active → review → blocked → ready → activity → inbox → observations (full) → session metadata (full) → working tree → quick commands. (3) Primer: top 5 ready, 10 activity items, inbox stat line only. Full: all ready, 20 activity, 20 untriaged inbox, observations section, metadata. (4) @slug display with @short-ulid fallback. (5) Empty sections omitted entirely. (6) needs_work visually distinct from in_progress. (7) Notes shown inline under active/review tasks. (8) Observations loaded from meta context in full mode. (9) 37 new tests + 2 updated tests covering all 15 ACs. All 3571 tests pass (3 known flaky ralph).",
        "supersedes": null
      }
    ],
    "todos": [],
    "automation": "eligible",
    "_sourceFile": "/workspace/.kspec/project.tasks.yaml"
