        "author": "@claude",
        "content": "Implementation notes:\n\nKey file: tests/cli/session-start-*.test.ts (new or extend existing)\nExisting test pattern: tests/cli/session-start-notes.test.ts\n\nTest coverage needed for all new ACs:\n- ac-primer-default: default output has correct sections\n- ac-full-sections: --full adds observations, metadata, more items\n- ac-brief-alias: --brief behaves same as no flags\n- ac-section-order: sections appear in defined order\n- ac-empty-skip: empty sections omitted entirely\n- ac-slug-display: tasks with slugs show @slug\n- ac-slug-fallback: tasks without slugs show @short-ulid, inbox always @short-ulid\n- ac-relative-time-human: human output uses relative times\n- ac-iso-time-json: JSON output uses ISO 8601\n- ac-dirty-tree-only: clean working tree omits section\n- ac-active-detail: in_progress/needs_work show title+description+notes\n- ac-needs-work-indicator: needs_work visually distinct from in_progress\n- ac-review-detail: pending_review shows title+notes\n- ac-notes-starvation: notes split fairly across statuses\n- ac-json-raw-preserved: JSON has recently_completed and recent_commits unchanged\n- ac-unlocks-shown/omit-zero/unresolvable: from @session-start-unlocks\n- ac-activity-merge/trailer-link/sort/dedup/no-git: from @session-start-activity-timeline\n- ac-inbox-stat-line/full-list/all-triaged/untriaged-def: from @session-start-inbox-triage\n- ac-computed-inbox/unlocks/activity: from @session-start-computed-json\n\nUse setupTempFixtures(), kspec(), kspecJson<SessionContext>() helpers.\nAnnotate tests with // AC: @spec-ref ac-id comments.",
        "supersedes": null
