  {
    "_ulid": "01KJ7CNF3BR5K1DM2H6A67TYP2",
    "slugs": [],
    "title": "Audit and improve skills for agent self-sufficiency",
    "type": "task",
    "description": "Ralph loop audit revealed agents spending 139 messages searching YAML files for trait definitions instead of using kspec item get (1 command). Skills should contain enough context for agents to use CLI efficiently for common lookups. An agent should: 1) identify which skills are most commonly invoked during task-work, 2) find patterns where agents resort to raw file search instead of CLI commands, 3) update skills to include lookup recipes (e.g. 'to find a trait: kspec item get @trait-name'). High-impact, automatable.",
    "spec_ref": null,
    "meta_ref": null,
    "plan_ref": null,
    "status": "completed",
    "blocked_by": [],
    "closed_reason": "Merged in PR #521. Added CLI lookup tables to 6 skills (task-work, review, writing-specs, triage-inbox, local-review, pr-review) and a cli-lookups convention to kspec-agents.md. Addresses root cause of agents wasting 139+ messages searching YAML files instead of using kspec item get.",
    "depends_on": [],
    "context": [],
    "priority": 3,
    "tags": [
      "skills",
      "agent-quality"
    ],
    "vcs_refs": [],
    "created_at": "2026-02-24T08:36:17.130Z",
    "started_at": "2026-02-25T02:41:55.317Z",
    "completed_at": "2026-02-25T03:01:45.161Z",
    "notes": [
      {
        "_ulid": "01KJ7D1FTMGBZ3STQN8ZZCF9M7",
        "created_at": "2026-02-24T08:42:51.092Z",
        "author": "@claude",
        "content": "## Audit Results (from ralph loop post-mortem)\n\n### Root Cause\nAgents see trait references (e.g. \"Inherited from @trait-error-guidance\") in kspec item get output but don't know to run `kspec item get @trait-slug` to resolve them. They fall back to searching .kspec/modules/*.yaml files one by one — 139 messages in one observed case.\n\n### Skills to Update (prioritized)\n\n**HIGH impact (fix first):**\n1. `/kspec:task-work` — Add CLI lookup table after \"Verify Work Is Needed\" section. Include: task get, item get, trait get, search, item list, trait list. Add explicit pattern: \"When item get shows 'Inherited from @trait-slug', run item get @trait-slug. Do NOT search YAML files.\"\n2. `/kspec:review` — Add \"Looking Up Trait Definitions\" subsection under Trait AC Coverage. Add golden path: item get → trait get → grep for annotations → validate.\n3. `local-review` (Claude skill) — Expand step 1 to say \"for each inherited trait, run kspec item get @trait-slug\". Expand step 3 with trait lookup recipe.\n\n**MEDIUM impact:**\n4. `pr-review` (Claude skill) — Add trait lookup reminder in AC Coverage section.\n5. `/kspec:writing-specs` — Add \"Finding Where Things Live\" section with search/list/item get recipes.\n\n**LOW impact:**\n6. `triage-inbox` — Replace `kspec item list | grep` with `kspec search`.\n\n### Cross-Cutting\nConsider adding a \"CLI Lookups\" convention rule via `kspec meta set` so it appears in AGENTS.md Essential Rules for all agents regardless of skill.\n\n### Specific Content\nThe audit agent drafted exact text to add to each skill. The key table to add everywhere:\n\n| Need | Command |\n|------|---------|\n| Task details | `kspec task get @ref` |\n| Spec + all ACs | `kspec item get @ref` |\n| Trait definition | `kspec item get @trait-slug` or `kspec trait get @trait-slug` |\n| Search by keyword | `kspec search \"keyword\"` |\n| List by type | `kspec item list --type feature` |\n| All traits | `kspec trait list` |\n\n### Automation Notes\nStraightforward text additions to skill markdown files. No code changes. Can be automated once content is approved.",
        "supersedes": null
      },
      {
        "_ulid": "01KJ9B43F8ETD86JSQT440JXYQ",
        "created_at": "2026-02-25T02:47:48.456Z",
        "author": "@claude",
        "content": "Updated 6 skill files with CLI lookup tables and anti-patterns. Changes: (1) task-work: added CLI Lookups section with lookup table + key pattern for resolving inherited traits, (2) review: added CLI Lookups section with trait resolution guidance, (3) writing-specs: added Finding Things section with discovery commands, (4) triage-inbox: replaced 'kspec item list | grep' with 'kspec search', (5) local-review: added CLI Lookups section, (6) pr-review: added CLI Lookups section. Also added 'cli-lookups' convention via kspec meta (4 rules) which now appears in kspec-agents.md for all agents. Rebuilt plugin. All 3603 tests pass (2 known flaky ralph signal tests).",
        "supersedes": null
      }
    ],
    "todos": [],
    "automation": "eligible",
    "_sourceFile": "/workspace/.kspec/project.tasks.yaml"
