    "started_at": "2026-02-25T02:25:09.340Z",
    "completed_at": "2026-02-25T02:41:24.886Z",
    "notes": [
      {
        "_ulid": "01KJ9A2C9VQVZRCBZQCGY01X2Z",
        "created_at": "2026-02-25T02:29:23.387Z",
        "author": "@claude",
        "content": "Added N/A trait AC annotation format to templates/agents-sections/05-commit-convention.md under a new '### N/A Trait ACs' subsection. Documents the required format: `// AC: @trait-slug ac-N — N/A: reason`. Emphasizes the // AC: prefix is required (not prose), annotations should be grouped, and must be machine-parseable. Regenerated kspec-agents.md. All 3604 tests pass (1 known flaky ralph test).",
