        "content": "Refactor human-readable activity timeline to group commits under their linked tasks. Tasks are top-level entries, linked commits nest beneath with visual connector (pipe or bent arrow). Orphan commits (no task trailer) appear as standalone indented entries. Primarily a display-layer change to the session start human formatter. The activity_timeline data already has linked_commit type with task refs, so grouping logic can work from the existing data structure. JSON output can stay flat or optionally adopt grouped structure.",
