        "content": "Implemented hierarchical activity timeline display. Changes: (1) Task groups: linked commits grouped under their task with visual connectors (├─ for non-last, └─ for last). (2) Task entries use ✓ marker as top-level entries. (3) Orphan commits use ○ marker for visual distinction. (4) Groups sorted by most recent event; commits within group sorted chronologically (oldest first). (5) Multi-commit dedup: multiple commits referencing same task appear nested under one task entry. (6) Updated [completed] badge to ✓ across activity section. Updated tests in session-start-activity-timeline.test.ts (19 tests) and session-start-notes.test.ts. All 3603 tests pass (2 known flaky ralph signal tests).",
