  {
    "_ulid": "01KJ93JJFTXFE4F8084NAXMHG3",
    "slugs": [
      "task-fix-ralph-signal-cleanup"
    ],
    "title": "Fix unawaited async cleanup in ralph signal handler",
    "type": "bug",
    "spec_ref": "@ralph-task-limit",
    "meta_ref": null,
    "plan_ref": null,
    "status": "completed",
    "blocked_by": [],
    "closed_reason": "Merged in PR #518. Fixed unawaited async cleanup in ralph signal handler — changed fire-and-forget Promise.all().finally() to properly awaited async IIFE pattern. Budget.json now reliably cleaned up on SIGINT/SIGTERM. Updated static analysis test in end-loop.test.ts. Added @ralph-task-limit ac-signal-cleanup AC annotations to signal tests. Codex review clean.",
    "depends_on": [],
    "context": [],
    "priority": 2,
    "tags": [
      "ralph",
      "testing"
    ],
    "vcs_refs": [],
    "created_at": "2026-02-25T00:35:53.978Z",
    "started_at": "2026-02-25T01:40:10.257Z",
    "completed_at": "2026-02-25T01:57:06.152Z",
    "notes": [
      {
        "_ulid": "01KJ93JT319K06HE6MY2271F7H",
        "created_at": "2026-02-25T00:36:01.762Z",
        "author": "@claude",
        "content": "Bug: ralph signal handler (src/cli/commands/ralph.ts ~lines 1057-1071) queues Promise.all for fs.unlink(budget) + closeSession() but does not await it — process.exit(0) in .finally() fires before I/O completes. This causes budget.json to persist after SIGINT, failing ac-signal-cleanup.\n\nRoot cause: fire-and-forget async cleanup in synchronous signal handler. The normal exit path (finally block ~line 1513) correctly awaits the same cleanup.\n\nFix: await cleanup promises before calling process.exit(). Either use async handler pattern or set a flag and let the event loop drain. Only one instance of this pattern exists — no other signal handlers in the codebase have this issue.\n\nTest: tests/ralph/session-budget-integration.test.ts testSignalCleanup() — currently flaky, should pass reliably after fix.",
        "supersedes": null
      },
      {
        "_ulid": "01KJ97RE610HN6E5C80W89FM8J",
        "created_at": "2026-02-25T01:49:00.481Z",
        "author": "@claude",
        "content": "Fixed unawaited async cleanup in ralph signal handler. The signalCleanup function created Promise.all() for budget deletion + session close but never awaited it — process.exit(0) in .finally() fired before I/O completed. Changed to async IIFE pattern: void (async () => { try { await Promise.all([...]); } catch {} finally { process.exit(0); } })(). Updated static analysis test in end-loop.test.ts to match new pattern. Added AC annotation for @ralph-task-limit ac-signal-cleanup to both SIGINT and SIGTERM signal tests. All tests pass.",
        "supersedes": null
      }
    ],
    "todos": [],
    "automation": "eligible",
    "_sourceFile": "/workspace/.kspec/project.tasks.yaml"
  },
