    "title": "Refactor session.ts — split into focused modules",
    "type": "task",
    "description": "session.ts is 2806 lines with 6 distinct concerns crammed into one file. Split it into focused modules to improve maintainability before further changes cause drift.\n\n## Current Structure (what to extract)\n\n| Concern | Lines | Target File |\n|---------|-------|-------------|\n| Types/interfaces (SessionContext, summaries, etc.) | ~80-308 | src/cli/commands/session/types.ts |\n| Data gathering (gatherSessionContext, collectRecentNotes, all to*Summary mappers) | ~310-868 | src/cli/commands/session/context.ts |\n| Checkpoint logic (performCheckpoint, getIterationStats) | ~870-1097 | src/cli/commands/session/checkpoint.ts |\n| Human output formatting (formatSessionContext — 510 lines, all format helpers) | ~1099-1636 | src/cli/commands/session/format.ts |\n| Session log commands (list, show, stats, search + their formatters) | ~1780-2513 | src/cli/commands/session/log.ts |\n| Session create + env injection | ~2515-2683 | src/cli/commands/session/create.ts |\n| Command registration (registerSessionCommands, wiring) | ~2685-2806 | stays as src/cli/commands/session.ts (barrel) |\n\n## Execution Plan\n\n1. Create `src/cli/commands/session/` directory\n2. Extract `types.ts` first — all interfaces, type aliases, constants. Everything else imports from here.\n3. Extract `context.ts` — gatherSessionContext(), all to*Summary() mappers, collectRecentNotes(), buildActivityTimeline(). Imports types. Exports the main gatherSessionContext function.\n4. Extract `format.ts` — formatSessionContext() and all its helper functions (formatDuration, status color helpers, displayRef lambda should become a proper exported function). Imports types.\n5. Extract `log.ts` — sessionLogListAction, sessionLogShowAction, sessionLogStatsAction, sessionLogSearchAction, and their private format helpers (formatDurationLong, summarizeEventData, formatSearchTimestamp). These have ZERO dependency on the session-start code.\n6. Extract `checkpoint.ts` — performCheckpoint, getIterationStats. Used by ralph integration.\n7. Extract `create.ts` — sessionCreateAction, performEnvInjection, all env injection helpers.\n8. Update `session.ts` to be a barrel that imports from sub-modules and wires up registerSessionCommands.\n9. Run full test suite — ALL existing tests must pass without modification. The public API (registerSessionCommands) doesn't change.\n\n## Key Constraints\n\n- **No behavior changes.** This is a pure structural refactor. If a test fails, the extraction was wrong.\n- **No renaming.** Keep all function names identical. Only file locations change.\n- **Preserve exports.** If anything was exported from session.ts, it must still be importable from the same path (re-export from barrel).\n- **Watch for circular deps.** types.ts must not import from other session modules. context.ts and format.ts both need types but should not import each other.\n- **The duplicate logic (note formatting, displayRef, priority coloring, status colors) should be extracted into shared helpers in format.ts** during the move — don't just copy-paste the duplication into the new file.\n\n## Cleanup Opportunities (do during extraction)\n\n- Deduplicate the 4x status color ternary into a single `statusColor(status)` helper\n- Deduplicate the 3x priority formatting into `formatPriority(level)` helper  \n- Deduplicate the note-display formatting (active tasks vs pending review) into `formatInlineNote(note, isFull)` helper\n- Consolidate the 5 variants of displayRef into a single `getDisplayRef(item)` utility\n- Remove dead code: unused `_allTasks` parameter on `toBlockedTaskSummary`, unused imports (listSessions, IterationSummary, SearchMatch)\n- Fix `removeAllListeners()` in readStdinIfAvailable to use named handlers instead\n\n## Verification\n\nAfter extraction:\n1. `npx vitest run` — all tests pass\n2. `npm run build` — clean build, no type errors\n3. `kspec session start` — works correctly (manual smoke test)\n4. `git diff --stat` should show session.ts shrinking to <200 lines",
    "spec_ref": null,
    "meta_ref": null,
    "plan_ref": null,
    "status": "completed",
    "blocked_by": [],
    "closed_reason": "Merged in PR #523. Refactored session.ts (2807 lines) into 8 focused modules under src/cli/commands/session/: types.ts, context.ts, format.ts, checkpoint.ts, log.ts, create.ts, commands.ts, index.ts. Barrel file preserves backward compatibility. Deduplicated helpers (statusColor, formatPriority, formatInlineNote, getDisplayRef), removed dead code. All tests pass, clean build.",
