        "content": "Refactored session.ts (2807 lines) into 8 focused modules under src/cli/commands/session/:\n- types.ts (271 lines): All interfaces and type aliases\n- context.ts (647 lines): gatherSessionContext(), getIterationStats(), all mapper functions\n- format.ts (577 lines): formatSessionContext(), formatCheckpointResult(), deduplicated helpers (getDisplayRef, formatPriority, statusColor, formatInlineNote)\n- checkpoint.ts (179 lines): performCheckpoint()\n- log.ts (772 lines): All session log commands (list, show, stats, search)\n- create.ts (190 lines): sessionCreateAction(), performEnvInjection()\n- commands.ts (312 lines): registerSessionCommands() and action wiring\n- index.ts (42 lines): Barrel re-exports\n\nsession.ts reduced to 39-line barrel for backward compatibility.\n\nCleanup applied during extraction:\n1. Removed unused _allTasks parameter from toBlockedTaskSummary\n2. Removed unused imports (listSessions, IterationSummary, SearchMatch)\n3. Fixed removeAllListeners() in readStdinIfAvailable to use named handlers\n4. Deduplicated 4x status color ternary into statusColor() helper\n5. Deduplicated 3x priority formatting into formatPriority() helper\n6. Deduplicated note display into formatInlineNote() helper\n7. Consolidated displayRef lambda into exported getDisplayRef() utility\n\nOne test updated: session-create.test.ts static analysis test now reads from session/create.ts. All 112 session tests + 51 session-create tests + 3 iteration-stats tests pass. Build clean.",
