    "_ulid": "01KJA21TE7JMYSEQ3G0VZ9AKWE",
    "slugs": [],
    "title": "Consolidate naming inconsistencies in session modules",
    "type": "task",
    "description": "After the session.ts split (depends on @01KJ9ZBT), consolidate naming inconsistencies across the new modules.\n\n## Duration Formatters\n\nTwo formatters with subtle behavioral differences and unclear names:\n- formatDuration: omits seconds when hours are present\n- formatDurationLong: shows \"Xh Ym\" when both present, \"Xm Ys\" without hours\n\nConsolidate into a single formatDuration(ms, options?) where options controls precision/verbosity. Or rename to make the behavioral difference clear (e.g., formatDurationCompact vs formatDurationVerbose).\n\n## displayRef Pattern (5 variants)\n\nFive different approaches to the same thing:\n1. displayRef lambda in formatSessionContext\n2. getRef lambda in getIterationStats\n3. Inline `task.slugs.length > 0 ? task.slugs[0] : null` in to*TaskSummary mappers\n4. @-prefixed variant in other mappers\n5. Various inline ternaries\n\nConsolidate into a single `getDisplayRef(item: { slugs: string[], _ulid: string }): string` utility in types.ts or a shared utils module. Should return `@slug` if slugs exist, otherwise short ULID.\n\n## Status Color (4 duplicates)\n\nThe same completed->green, active->blue, else->yellow ternary appears 4 times across format functions. Extract to `statusColor(status: string): chalk.Chalk`.\n\n## Priority Formatting (3 duplicates)\n\n`task.priority <= 2 ? chalk.red(...) : chalk.gray(...)` appears 3 times. Extract to `formatPriority(level: number): string`.\n\nDepends on: @01KJ9ZBT (session.ts refactor)",
    "spec_ref": null,
    "meta_ref": null,
    "plan_ref": null,
    "status": "completed",
    "blocked_by": [],
    "closed_reason": "Merged in PR #532. Consolidated naming inconsistencies: renamed formatDuration→formatDurationCompact/formatDurationVerbose, extracted sessionStatusColor() in log.ts, consolidated displayRef via getDisplayRef() in format.ts, renamed SessionContext→SessionStartContext. All CI passed, clean review.",
