        "created_at": "2026-02-25T17:51:31.494Z",
        "author": "@claude",
        "content": "Implemented session-scoped filtering in checkpoint.ts. When KSPEC_SESSION_ID is set, checkpoint only warns about tasks belonging to the current session or unclaimed tasks. Tasks owned by other active sessions are excluded. Orphaned tasks (closed/missing session) are included via fail-safe. Session lookups use a per-checkpoint cache to avoid redundant filesystem reads. 10 integration tests added in tests/cli/session-checkpoint-scoping.test.ts, all passing. 160 existing CLI tests pass with no regressions.",
        "supersedes": null
      }
    ],
