  {
    "_ulid": "01KJAZARFTD5RQVVXM8430WZ6A",
    "slugs": [
      "task-ralph-missing-session-stamp"
    ],
    "title": "Investigate why ralph loop did not stamp session_id on task @01KJA3RQ",
    "type": "task",
    "description": "During a ralph loop session, task @01KJA3RQ was started in_progress but has no session_id. Ralph's session failed with an auth error (LOOP-FAIL:1). Either KSPEC_SESSION_ID was not injected before task start, or the failure happened before the stamp. Investigate the ralph task-start flow to ensure session_id is always stamped when running in a loop session.",
    "spec_ref": null,
    "meta_ref": null,
    "plan_ref": null,
    "status": "completed",
    "blocked_by": [],
    "closed_reason": "Merged in PR #541. Fixed KSPEC_SESSION_ID not being stamped on tasks in ralph loop. Root cause: Claude Code sandboxes child processes and doesn't forward parent env vars. Fix: adapter-aware env injection writes to harness-specific config (settings.local.json for Claude Code). Includes previous-value restore on cleanup, try/finally safety, and 14 new tests. Validated end-to-end with ralph loop.",
    "depends_on": [],
    "context": [],
    "priority": 2,
    "tags": [
      "bug",
      "sessions"
    ],
    "vcs_refs": [],
    "created_at": "2026-02-25T18:00:12.538Z",
    "started_at": "2026-02-25T22:44:35.669Z",
    "submitted_at": "2026-02-25T22:59:55.888Z",
    "completed_at": "2026-02-25T23:39:31.162Z",
    "notes": [
      {
        "_ulid": "01KJBFYQ65G9BKAW9WEBTRKT1D",
        "created_at": "2026-02-25T22:50:43.782Z",
        "author": "@claude",
        "content": "Root cause: Ralph passes KSPEC_SESSION_ID via spawner env (process env inheritance), but Claude Code sandboxes child processes and doesn't forward arbitrary parent env vars to commands run via Bash tool. The injection mechanism (injectClaudeCodeEnv → .claude/settings.json env section) exists but ralph doesn't call it. Fix: call injectClaudeCodeEnv() after session creation when adapter is claude-agent-acp, and clean up on session end.",
        "supersedes": null
      },
      {
        "_ulid": "01KJBGFH0F5G6KPC18RKMPFJDY",
        "created_at": "2026-02-25T22:59:54.512Z",
        "author": "@claude",
        "content": "Implementation complete. Added adapter-aware env injection to ralph loop: injectEnvForAdapter() writes KSPEC_SESSION_ID to harness-specific config (e.g. .claude/settings.json for Claude Code) after session creation. removeEnvForAdapter() cleans up in finally block and signal handlers. Added removeClaudeCodeEnv() and removeDotenvSessionId() helpers. Design is extensible — new harnesses just add a switch case. 10 new tests all passing, full suite green (pre-existing mock-acp timeout failures only).",
        "supersedes": null
      }
    ],
    "todos": [],
    "_sourceFile": "/workspace/.kspec/project.tasks.yaml"
  },
